📌 What is Model Deployment?

Model deployment means **making a trained machine learning model available for real-world use**.

Instead of running models only in notebooks, deployment allows:

* Users to interact with the model
* Applications to use predictions
* Models to run in production environments

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎯 Why Deployment is Important

Machine learning workflow:

```
Data Collection
      ↓
Data Cleaning
      ↓
Model Training
      ↓
Model Evaluation
      ↓
Model Deployment
```

Without deployment, a model **cannot be used by real users or systems**.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🛠️ Popular Deployment Tools

| Tool              | Purpose                   |
| ----------------- | ------------------------- |
| Streamlit         | Build ML web apps easily  |
| Flask             | Create APIs for ML models |
| FastAPI           | High-performance APIs     |
| Docker            | Containerize applications |
| AWS / GCP / Azure | Cloud deployment          |

This lesson focuses on:

* **Streamlit**
* **Flask**

