📦 Saving ML Models

Before deployment, models must be saved.

Common formats:

| Library    | Method        |
| ---------- | ------------- |
| Pickle     | pickle.dump() |
| Joblib     | joblib.dump() |
| TensorFlow | SavedModel    |
| PyTorch    | torch.save()  |

Example:

```python
import pickle

pickle.dump(model, open("model.pkl","wb"))
```

